cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use vo-models in your work, please cite it using these metadata."
title: vo-models
abstract: >-
  Pydantic data models for IVOA service protocols. Provides validated,
  serializable Python (pydantic-xml) models for IVOA protocols including UWS,
  VOSI, VODataService, VOResource, TAPRegExt, and VORegistry, to support the
  development of IVOA-compliant services and clients.
type: software
version: 0.5.3
date-released: 2026-04-22
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/spacetelescope/vo-models"
url: "https://vo-models.readthedocs.io/"
keywords:
  - ivoa
  - virtual observatory
  - pydantic
  - pydantic-xml
  - astronomy
  - data models
authors:
